  "quality": {
    "review_status": "source_reviewed",
    "review_scope": "Source-scoped Au catalyst deposition, chemical beam epitaxy growth, composition and growth-interruption controls, catalyst-stop preparations, microscopy specimens and five single-nanowire optical contexts. All nine main pages were read in text and images. Exact physical batch identities, unlisted growth times and individual alloy line pressures remain unknown. Figure specimens are not silently joined to unreported recipes. This is not a complete laboratory SOP or a full-paper narrative Reader.",
    "missing_fields": [
      "Exact physical batch identifiers, unreported individual growth times/flows and measured atomic coordinates.",
      "Exact QD growth time and line pressures, excitation power, integration time and numerical peak/linewidth fits."
    ],
    "conflicts": [
      "Several spectral lines can arise from excitonic complexes or excited states according to the authors; their detailed origin is explicitly outside the paper’s scope. No definitive peak-state assignments or graph digitization."
    ],
